text = "[center][b][color=cyan]🪄 SPELL CRAFT EVOLUTION DEMO[/color][/b][/center]

[color=gold]Your Input Becomes Living Magic![/color]

[b]🔮 SPACECLAY SPELLS:[/b]
Press [color=orange]SPACE[/color] → Creates expanding spaceclay bursts
Watch clay particles flow to gravity wells

[b]⚡ SPELL BULLETS:[/b]
Press [color=cyan]ENTER[/color] → Fast magical projectiles
Cyan spinning bullets shoot to targets

[b]🌀 VOID MAGIC:[/b] 
Press [color=purple]ESCAPE[/color] → Dark void warping bullets
Purple energy that teleports through space

[b]💎 RUNE CRYSTALS:[/b]
Type [color=magenta]any letter[/color] → Crystalline rune magic
Pink rotating prisms that manifest words

[b]🧲 GRAVITY WELLS:[/b]
[color=orange]Orange spheres[/color] attract all spell energy
Each spell flows differently toward the wells

[b]🎮 MOVEMENT:[/b]
[color=white]WASD[/color] - Fly around your spell workspace
[color=white]Mouse[/color] - Look around the magical realm

[color=lime]Experience the evolution from input to spell to consciousness![/color]"

